  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "If every model in your army has **CHAOS KNIGHTS** or **HERETIC ASTARTES**, your army can field **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** units, even without the Faction keyword you picked when you [selected your Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction). Their combined points cap is set by your [battle size](vsdata:core-rule/select-battle-size):\n\n- 250 points at most at Incursion\n- 500 points at most at Strike Force\n- 750 points at most at Onslaught\n\nNone of them can be your **WARLORD** or be given Enhancements.\n\nFor each of **KHORNE**, **TZEENTCH**, **NURGLE** and **SLAANESH**, the units with that keyword your army includes this way that are not **BATTLELINE** cannot outnumber the **BATTLELINE** units with it that it includes this way.",
